{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You Are Circle. You are <i>round</i>, and round is good. You are equipped with <strong>upgradable active &amp; passive abilities</strong>. Flow through the procedurally generated maze-like worlds, and defeat <i>pointy</i> evil foes to collect experience, which is also round. Gather enough and you get to choose between powerful level ups for your abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578190/extras/27bcd7f079e22d087266edfc22662d86.poster.avif?t=1774033999\" width=780 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578190/extras/27bcd7f079e22d087266edfc22662d86.webm?t=1774033999\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578190/extras/27bcd7f079e22d087266edfc22662d86.mp4?t=1774033999\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can execute devastating combos with your active abilities. For example, use <strong>Crash</strong> to quickly move into a group of enemies and stun them, while simultaneously using <strong>Pull</strong> to draw them close enough to finally finish them off with the huge area-of-effect damage of <strong>Slam</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578190/extras/4aa8921e01dde9b59700e7b3f85de63d.poster.avif?t=1774033999\" width=780 height=294 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578190/extras/4aa8921e01dde9b59700e7b3f85de63d.webm?t=1774033999\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578190/extras/4aa8921e01dde9b59700e7b3f85de63d.mp4?t=1774033999\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new mechanics, abilities and upgrades by reaching special milestones. Gather coins from defeated foes to permanently upgrade yourself between runs to become even stronger. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Actively control up to 4 abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip up to 6 passive abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >35+ active &amp; passive unlockable abilities to get during runs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >65+ permanent upgrades to Circle in the survivors-like meta-progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >25+ milestones that  unlock new features</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3578190?t=1774033999","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3578190?t=1774033999","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578190/04a5d5dff579fbe813977601df2a41541121fd47/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774033999","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578190/04a5d5dff579fbe813977601df2a41541121fd47/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774033999","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3947010,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You Are Circle. You are <i>round</i>, and round is good. You are equipped with <strong>upgradable active &amp; passive abilities</strong>. Flow through the procedurally generated maze-like worlds, and defeat <i>pointy</i> evil foes to collect experience, which is also round. Gather enough and you get to choose between powerful level ups for your abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578190/extras/27bcd7f079e22d087266edfc22662d86.poster.avif?t=1774033999\" width=780 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578190/extras/27bcd7f079e22d087266edfc22662d86.webm?t=1774033999\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578190/extras/27bcd7f079e22d087266edfc22662d86.mp4?t=1774033999\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can execute devastating combos with your active abilities. For example, use <strong>Crash</strong> to quickly move into a group of enemies and stun them, while simultaneously using <strong>Pull</strong> to draw them close enough to finally finish them off with the huge area-of-effect damage of <strong>Slam</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578190/extras/4aa8921e01dde9b59700e7b3f85de63d.poster.avif?t=1774033999\" width=780 height=294 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578190/extras/4aa8921e01dde9b59700e7b3f85de63d.webm?t=1774033999\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578190/extras/4aa8921e01dde9b59700e7b3f85de63d.mp4?t=1774033999\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new mechani